{
  "id": "PHP.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "PHP",
  "reference": "Abafilipi 3",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eky'enzindo barumuna bange, mushemelerwe aha rw'omujwangano gwanyu n'Omukama. Okubahandikira ebigambo byonene byonene inye tikulikundemesa, kandi nainywe ekyo nikibagasira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muramanya abantu babi abo embwa, abaikara bakaliliize okutahirirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwe n'ichwe tutahiriirwe kwokwokwo. Ichwe abafukamira Ruhanga twemire na Mwoyo, mara nitwebuga Yesu Kirisito, kandi ebikorwa by'aheru ebyo titubyesigire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'orwo inye kandi ndikushobora kubyesiga. K'omuntu araba nabona nashobora kwesiga eby'aheru, leronu inye ninshagaho: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakantahiri aha kiro kya munana. Mba Mwisiraeli ow'oruganda rwa Benjamini, ndi Muyahudi n'akagere. Aha bikwete Amateka mba Mufarisayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ekihika nagira kingi nagingiza enteko. Leronu okwo omuntu aragirwa kuba mugorogoki aha rw'enshonga y'okukwata Amateka, ahali ekyo nabaga nyakatetere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ebyo nabonaga biina omugasho ahali inye, nkabihwamu aha rwa Yesu Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazima buli kantu nkakahwamu aha rw'enshonga y'okumanya amagoba g'okumanya Yesu Kirisito Omukama wange. Ebintu byona nkabihwamu aha rwa wenene, nimbibona nk'omwejuno, Kirisito ashobore kuba niwe aba itunga lyange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mara njwangane nawe, ti aha rwa bugorogoki obwange nyabwange obuzarukana omu Mateka, kyonkai obugorogoki obwo tubonesibwa okwesiga Kirisito. Obugorogoki obulikwema ahali Ruhanga butabuka aha kwesiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyije mbone kumumanya n'okumanya amani g'okuhimbukakwe, nshashe nka wenene, nfe nka wenene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kakilikushoboka nshobore kuhimbuka omu bafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tikugir'oti ebi nabiboine anga nabaire mugorogoki. Nintaho amani kubona emperwa egyo, Yesu Kirisito akandonka naba wa wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barumuna bange, tindikugira nti emperwa egyo nagiboine. Ekintu kimoi kyonkai ekyo ndikukora, kwebwa ebyo nakozire, kandi nintaho amani kubona ebili omu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyitanira omugendelero gwange, niyo mperwa ey'oruguru eyo Ruhanga yatweteire kujwangana na Yesu Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichwe abalikuhiga obugorogoki tutekeleze emitekeleze nk'egi. Kandi kamuraba nimutekeleza kundi aha kintu kyona kyona, ekyo nakyo Ruhanga alikibashurulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai amazima ago twaboine tube nigo tugumaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barumuna bange, mwikare nimundondora. Mwekomye abalikwekomya obulebero obwo twabahaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba haliho bangi abo ndabagambiire emirundi nyingi, mara na mbwenu ninshuba nimbabagambira nindira, omu mirolere yabo nibashemelerwa okufa kwa Kirisito aha musaraba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibaija kufa kubi, orubunda niwe ruhanga wabo, nibebuga ebigoko byabo, amagezi gabo bagataire aha bintu by'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ichwe owaitu n'omw'iguru, ekyo nikyo kilikutuha okulindilira Omurokozi, Omukama Yesu Kirisito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alikwija kuhindura omubili gwaitu ogujege kaguba nk'ogwa wenene ogw'ekitinwa, nakoza obushobora obumuhindura Mukama w'ebintu byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
